    "ruleNumber": "18.07",
    "summary": "A unit can make a **Shock Disembark Move** only when another rule allows it and the unit:\n\n- is embarked in a **TRANSPORT** on the battlefield\n- boarded it before this phase\n\nSet it up using [Set Up](vsdata:core-rule/set-up) (03.02), every model wholly within 3″ of the **TRANSPORT**. It cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.",
